Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 18:13:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add LODF matrix computation API wired to
 powsybl-open-loadflow

Expose pypowsybl.sensitivity.compute_lodf_matrix(network,
monitored_branch_ids, outaged_branch_ids, parameters) returning a pandas
DataFrame with one row per monitored branch and one column per outaged
branch. The computation delegates to open-loadflow's LodfComputer, which
computes all factors with a single multiple right-hand side sparse
resolution of the DC linear system. By convention the LODF of a branch
for its own outage is -1, and the factors of outages breaking the
network connectivity are reported as NaN.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U4QG5WNJWFjqfFxQHvDcga
