Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Temporarily use powsybl-open-loadflow 2.4.0-SNAPSHOT for
 LODF API

To remove once a powsybl-open-loadflow release including the LODF
computation (and the vectorized DC equation system) is available in
powsybl-dependencies. As this open-loadflow build requires powsybl-core
7.3.0, the core BOM is imported explicitly, powsybl-loadflow-validation
is declared explicitly (it is no longer brought transitively by
open-loadflow), and OperationalLimitsDataframeAdder is adapted to the
FlowsLimitsHolder.getAllSelectedOperationalLimitsGroups return type
change (Collection to List) of iidm 7.3.0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
